    "updated_at": "2022-12-16T14:54:29Z",
    "body": "Hey @johnathan79717, I noticed https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/36158 which seems to be doing what this issue wants. That seems like a good change, but we should reflect it in the specification if we're going to change the tests.\r\n\r\nIn particular making the API always return \"null\" and leaving the underlying concept as-is for now is I think what you are pursuing?",
