    "created_at": "2023-01-16T16:55:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-01-16T16:55:39Z",
    "body": "I'd rather not introduce a novel origin value. Remember that web content cannot observe the specialness of `file:` URLs. Only when you navigate to a `file:` URL you might be able to \"appreciate\" its rather unique origin behavior. However, I think we should optimize for websites playing with `file:` URLs and give the same kind of answer they would get for unrecognized schemes.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
